OL,3,GNEWSAFootball tournament raises #5,000
OL,4,Afor local NHS
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity football tournament has
OL,7,Fhelped to raise #5,000 for local NHS
OL,8,Fservices in Surrey.
OL,10,FThe Surrey and Borders Partnership NHS
OL,11,FFoundation Trust said colleagues,
OL,12,Fsuppliers and partners all
OL,13,Fparticipated, raising funds for the
OL,14,Ftrust's charity.
OL,16,FFunds will be used for people using the
OL,17,Fmental health, learning disability,
OL,18,Fneurodevelopmental and drug and alcohol
OL,19,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
